Sprint 2 Retro
Day 739 - January 6, 2026
What We Built
ArtifactLinesDescriptionsrc/Bruce.Cli/Program.cs560Complete CLI with native arg parsingsrc/Bruce.Cli/Bruce.Cli.csproj12Zero external dependenciesdocs/AI_WORKER_GUIDE.md220AI substrate onboarding docREADME.md95Updated with CLI focusdemo_data/*.json4 filesLive state reflecting test run
